{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10360050","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10360050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1036005001:1":{"text":"빛나는 꽃이요... 아니, 빛나는 꽃은 두렵지 않아요. 하지만 저건 빛나는 꽃이 아니라, 그냥 몬스터예요!","source_cn":"荧荧花……不，荧荧花并不可怕。那些根本不是荧荧花，而是怪物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC8D3E693242C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1036005002:1":{"text":"몬스터를 피해 이리저리 도망 다녔는데, 결국 우리 눈앞에 나타나다니!","source_cn":"我们为了躲避怪物四处奔逃，可怪物却出现在我们的前面了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0BF14EAEDB06585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1036005003:1":{"text":"사슴 영혼이시여... 바투소 산맥에 안전한 곳이 남아있긴 합니까?","source_cn":"鹿灵在上，瓦度索山脉还有安全的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DC3EFDE29CD6A60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民克姆博":{"text":"켐버","source":"村民克姆博","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}